  "notes": "Cash basis county. Governmental statement p4 (Total Governmental column); roll-forward 11,063,418 + 10,937,168 - 11,483,570 + 2,987,238 - 2,987,238 = 10,517,016. Ending cash is the total fund balance (cash 10,456,388 + designated investments 60,628); ending_investments informational. Balance sheet from the governmental funds Balance Sheet (p3), totals equal the Statement of Net Position (p1). Detail: General, Road & Bridge, Health Insurance and Inheritance Tax budget schedules (pp5-9); General Fund Taxes 5,535,516 split into property and motor vehicle tax from the General column on p4. Nonmajor special revenue funds (14 funds) from the combining schedule Total column (p12); the per-fund budget schedules (pp13-15, totals only) are not recorded to avoid double counting. Digital Radio's 75,000 is Miscellaneous receipts in the combining schedule but an operating transfer in on its budget schedule (p15). Read pages 1-15 of 15"
}
